@lyngmn/dsh-korean is a Korean language pack for DeepSeek Harness made by
LYNGMN. It is not an official DeepSeek language pack and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by DeepSeek.

The files under source/ are English user-interface strings extracted from
DeepSeek Harness packages (@deepseek-ai/*), which are distributed under the
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek. They are kept here only as the
reference text that the Korean translation is checked against.

The Korean translations under ko/ and all code in this repository were
written independently for this project.

